    </fo:page-sequence>
    <fo:page-sequence master-reference="single-page" initial-page-number="3">
        <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-region-after">
            <fo:block text-align="outside" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" line-height="14pt">
                          Seite
          
                <fo:page-number/>
            </fo:block>
        </fo:static-content>
        <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body">
            <fo:block break-after="page" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif">
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="20pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start">Datenbank</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Datenbank ist die physische Implementierung des logischen Datenmodells. Dabei wird idealerweise jeder Entität und jeder 
      Beziehung eine Tabelle zugeordnet. Aus Performance-Gründen wird die Datenbank oft nicht normalisiert abgebildet, sondern es 
      wird mit Datensichten oder denormalisierten Tabellen gearbeitet, dies ist aber bei kleinen Datenbanken wie der CBM-Datenbank 
      nicht notwendig. Im Grunde könnte man auch in dieser Anwendungsdomäne auch ohne Datenbank areiten, jedoch ist sie hier aus 
      didaktischen Gründen nützlich.
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Implementierung">Implementierung</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Das zugrundeliegende Relationale Datenbank-Managementsystem (RDBMS) ist ein SQL Server 2022 von Microsoft. Als Werkzeug zur 
      Administration der Datenbank wird dasw SQL Server Management Studio verwendet. 
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Überblick">Überblick</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Insgesamt besteht die Datenbank aus drei Tabellen, wie in folgender Übersicht zu sehen ist:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block space-after="4pt" space-before="4pt" line-height="0pt">
                    <fo:external-graphic src="url('file:///C:/Users/Test/Daten/Web/xdoc/xcbm/img/Datenbank.svg')"/>
                </fo:block>
                <fo:block space-after="6pt" space-before="6pt" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-style="italic">
        Abbildung 1: Tabellen der CBM-Datenbank
      </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Erstellung">Erstellung</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Erstellung der Datenbank benötigt eine Administrator-Account. Mit folgendem Kommando wird die Datenbank CBM angelegt:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Courier" font-size="6pt" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-treatment="preserve" space-before="4pt" space-after="4pt" text-align="start" white-space-collapse="false">create database CBM;</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Tabelle Magazine">Tabelle Magazine</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Tabelle Magazin ist die Implementierung der Entität Magazin. Sie wird mit dem folgenden Kommando in der Datenbank 
      angelegt:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Courier" font-size="6pt" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-treatment="preserve" space-before="0pt" space-after="4pt" text-align="start" white-space-collapse="false">
        create table CBM.dbo.Magazine (
          id integer not null,
          issue nvarchar(6) not null,
          primary key (id));	
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Tabelle besteht aus folgenden Feldern:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt">
                    <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%">
                        <fo:table-header>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Feld</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Datentyp</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Bedeutung</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-header>
                        <fo:table-body>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">id</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">int</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Technischer Schlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">issue</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">nvarchar(6)</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Fachlicher Schlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-body>
                    </fo:table>
                    <fo:block space-after="6pt" space-before="6pt" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-style="italic">Tabelle 1: Felder der Tabelle Magazine</fo:block>
                </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Tabelle ECO">Tabelle ECO</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Tabelle ECO ist die Implementierung der Entität Eröffnungsschlüssel. Sie wird mit dem folgenden Kommando in der Datenbank 
      angelegt:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Courier" font-size="6pt" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-treatment="preserve" space-before="0pt" space-after="4pt" text-align="start" white-space-collapse="false">
        create table CBM.dbo.ECO (
          id integer not null,
          ecokey char(03) not null,
          moves nvarchar(255) not null,	
          eco_description nvarchar(255) not null,
          primary key (id));	
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Tabelle besteht aus folgenden Feldern:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt">
                    <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%">
                        <fo:table-header>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Feld</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Datentyp</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Bedeutung</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-header>
                        <fo:table-body>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">id</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">int</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Technischer Schlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">ecokey</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">char(03)</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Fachlicher Schlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">moves</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">nvarchar(255)</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Anfangszüge</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">eco_description</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">nvarchar(255)</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Wikipedia-Beschreibung</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-body>
                    </fo:table>
                    <fo:block space-after="6pt" space-before="6pt" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-style="italic">Tabelle 2: Felder der Tabelle ECO</fo:block>
                </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Tabelle Magazine_ECO">Tabelle Magazine_ECO</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Tabelle Magazine_ECO ist die Implementierung der informationstragenden Beziehung Eröffnungsschlüssel. Sie wird mit dem folgenden Kommando in der Datenbank 
      angelegt:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Courier" font-size="6pt" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-treatment="preserve" space-before="0pt" space-after="4pt" text-align="start" white-space-collapse="false">
        create table CBM.dbo.Magazine_ECO(
          id integer not null,
          id_magazine integer not null,
          id_eco integer not null,
          cbm_eco_description nvarchar(255) not null,
          primary key (id));
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die Tabelle besteht aus folgenden Feldern:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt">
                    <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%">
                        <fo:table-header>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Feld</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Datentyp</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block background-color="#f0f0f0" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-weight="bold">Bedeutung</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-header>
                        <fo:table-body>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">id</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">int</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Technischer Schlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">id_magazine</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">int</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Fremdschlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">id_eco</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">int</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Fremdschlüssel</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                            <fo:table-row>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">cbm_eco_description</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">nvarchar(255)</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                                <fo:table-cell border-color="black" border-style="solid">
                                    <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt">Artikelkurzbeschreibung</fo:block>
                                </fo:table-cell>
                            </fo:table-row>
                        </fo:table-body>
                    </fo:table>
                    <fo:block space-after="6pt" space-before="6pt" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" font-style="italic">Tabelle 3: Felder der Tabelle Magazine_ECO</fo:block>
                </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="10pt" space-before="10pt" text-align="start" id="Query über alle drei Tabellen">Query über alle drei Tabellen</fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Die folgende Query stellt einen Join über alle drei verknüpften Tabellen dar:
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Courier" font-size="6pt" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-treatment="preserve" space-before="0pt" space-after="4pt" text-align="start" white-space-collapse="false">
        select t1.issue,
               t2.ecokey,
               t2.moves,
               t2.eco_description,
               t3.cbm_eco_description
        from   CBM.dbo.Magazine t1,
               CBM.dbo.ECO t2,
               CBM.dbo.Magazine_ECO t3
        where  t1.id = t3.id_magazine
        and    t2.id = t3.id_eco
        order by t2.ecokey;
    </fo:block>
                    
                <fo:block font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10pt" text-align="justify" space-before="10pt" space-after="10pt">
      Dieser Abfrage selektiert alle Eröffnungsartikel mitsamt den dazugehörigen Eröffnungsschlüsseln und Magazinen sowie den 
      dazugehörigen Beschreibungen und Zügen. Sortiert wird der Result Set am Ende nach den Eröffnungsschlüsseln wie in der 
      folgenden Teilmenge dessen zeigt:
